@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### Manifest
GET {{baseUrl}}/manifest


### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi


### Legal text - impressum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/impressum


### Legal text - privacy text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/privacy-text


### Legal text - not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/unknown


### Get terms-of-use status without token - unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/termsofuse/status


### Accept terms of use without token - unauthorized
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/termsofuse/accept


### Get current user's terms-of-use status - success
# Requires {{managedUserToken}} obtained through the OIDC Authorization Code Flow.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/termsofuse/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managedUserToken}}


### Accept terms of use for current user - success
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/termsofuse/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{managedUserToken}}


### Get current user's terms-of-use status after acceptance - success
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/legal/termsofuse/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managedUserToken}}
